Node ID=10 divine spirit
Text=I have known many names throughout history. In ancient Persia I was one of the divine Amesha Spentas, Armati. In the West I am numbered among the Cherubim. I am a spirit within you, and I wish to help you and protect you as I did Richard. 
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
