Node ID=10 lionheart
Text=During the time of the Disjunction, much of the world was thrown into chaos. Many died, and all might have been lost had I not found strength within your ancestor and joined with him. I have slept in your family's bloodline ever since that terrible time, awaiting a worthy host.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Do you mean I am the descendant of a king?
