Node ID=8 bastard child 2
Text=Richard traveled far and wide in the world and was not unattractive to the many women he encountered. He left behind him an unfortunate trail of bastard children, one of which was your ancestor. Though you are not in line for the throne, you have inherited other special gifts from Richard.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
