Node ID=400 khan hunger demon explanation
Text=Hold, Scion of Lionheart. There is a familiar power resonating in these caves. An absence...a void, a terrible power I have faced before. It is Tawrich, Daeva of Hunger. The demon would have sought the most powerful of the goblins to possess, most likely the goblin Khan himself.
