Node ID=400 tawrich
Text=Tawrich is the Daeva of Hunger, a powerful demon with a ravenous appetite for mortal flesh that is never sated. Throughout history, Tawrich has bonded with conquerors and raiders, seeking to devour the world through war and destruction. He has had many names. Buddhists call him Pretas and Rome knew him as Fames, but all know him as suffering.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
