Node ID=500 daevas explanation elemental
Text=Daevas are powerful demons, dedicated to causing strife and spreading evil across the world. The ancient Persians gave them names long ago. Each Daeva is unique and possesses a power of some evil aspect. They are eternally opposed by divine spirits and I have spent my existence fighting them and helping mortals resist their promises of power.
Should Have Voiceover=1

